sxml-xsd-test - the W3C XSD 1.1 test-suite driver of sxml (a developer tool)

Usage: sxml-xsd-test [--version] COMMAND [ARGUMENT...]

Commands:
  help  Show help for the program or for one command
  list  List tests with their documents, expected outcomes and applicability
  run   Run test cases and report them

Options:
  -h, --help     Show this help and exit
      --version  Print the version and exit

Run 'sxml-xsd-test help COMMAND' for help on one command.
Report bugs at https://github.com/tinyactors-dev/sxml/issues
